# A message's actions: copying the user's and the answer's text, quoting only a
# selection of the answer into the draft, and editing a message in the composer.
# iOS: testSimulatorCopiesSelectedOrWholeUserMessageText, testSimulatorSelectsAssistantTextInPlaceAndAddsOnlySelectionToDraft
expect "検証プロジェクト" 30000
press このプロジェクトで新しいチャット
type "AI に依頼する" "[selection] [immediate] 回答を選択します"
press 送信
expect "Needle Alpha Bravo." 30000
press 発言をコピー
expect_clipboard "[selection] [immediate] 回答を選択します"
press 回答をコピー
expect_clipboard "Second paragraph stays unselected."
select "*Needle Alpha*" Alpha
menu "*Needle Alpha*"
press チャットに追加
expect "> Alpha" after "AI に依頼する"
expect_absent "Needle" after "AI に依頼する"
screenshot quoted
press 入力欄で編集
expect "回答を選択します" after "AI に依頼する"
expect_absent "> Alpha"
